data: {"type": "text", "text": "### Battery pairing\nOur product data lists no documented battery pairing for the H2-10K-T3, so I cannot recommend a specific battery for it. The SAJ configuration instructions for the H2, HS2 and HS3 systems are the document to check for the intended storage combination.\n\n### Sizing the storage\nWhich battery capacity fits your home is a sizing question, and that is the Solution Configurator's work: it takes the PV size, consumption and backup wish you give and proposes a matching selection.", "refs": ["4107"]}

